==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Osamu Mikumo & Cat (Rare Cat)|Osamu Mikumo & Cat]], [[Yuma Kuga & Cat (Rare Cat)|Yuma Kuga & Cat]] and [[Chika Amatori & Cat (Special Cat)|Chika Amatori & Cat]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Marmod]] (100%) spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Marmod]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Black Marmod]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Marmod]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Marmod]]s (100%) spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**5 [[Red Marmod]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Black Marmod]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You need level 30 World trigger units by this point, spamming them will almost ensure an easy victory.

